{
  "version": 1,
  "partId": "pinball-entry-p4",
  "audioFile": "pinball-entry-part4.mp3",
  "durationSeconds": 322.114438,
  "method": "whisper-local",
  "preambleSeconds": 115.88,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "cue-1",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Section 4.",
      "start": 101.974,
      "end": 103.828,
      "preAudio": true
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-2",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You will hear part of a lecture about the science behind getting annoyed.",
      "start": 103.828,
      "end": 115.88,
      "preAudio": true
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-3",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40.",
      "start": 115.88,
      "end": 119.96,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-4",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now listen and answer questions 31 to 40.",
      "start": 119.96,
      "end": 123.78
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-5",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Hello everyone and thanks for coming.",
      "start": 123.78,
      "end": 125.82,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now, some of you might not think that you're impatient people.",
      "start": 125.82,
      "end": 129.56,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You rarely, if ever, get furious or upset about things.",
      "start": 129.56,
      "end": 132.96,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-8",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But I can guarantee that for every single one of us,",
      "start": 132.96,
      "end": 136.7,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-9",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "there are things which annoy you regularly.",
      "start": 136.7,
      "end": 139.08,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-10",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Getting annoyed is part of human nature.",
      "start": 139.08,
      "end": 141.46,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-11",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But what kind of things make us annoyed",
      "start": 141.46,
      "end": 144.18,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-12",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and what's the scientific explanation for it?",
      "start": 144.18,
      "end": 146.56,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-13",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "First of all, there are plenty of things in modern life",
      "start": 146.56,
      "end": 150.3,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-14",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "that are incredibly annoying.",
      "start": 150.3,
      "end": 150.48,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-15",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "From pop-up ads to being asked to make it through a test",
      "start": 150.48,
      "end": 154.56,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-16",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "to prove you're not a robot when you try to get onto a web page.",
      "start": 154.56,
      "end": 158.3,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-17",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But there are plenty of old-fashioned things too.",
      "start": 158.3,
      "end": 161.02
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-18",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "People blocking an escalator at the exact point",
      "start": 161.02,
      "end": 163.74,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-19",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "when you have just one minute left to catch your train.",
      "start": 163.74,
      "end": 167.48,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-20",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Or people who open their mouths while chewing their food",
      "start": 167.48,
      "end": 170.88
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-21",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "are just two out of thousands of things",
      "start": 170.88,
      "end": 173.6
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-22",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "that we might find irritating.",
      "start": 173.6,
      "end": 175.3
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-23",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "In short, there seem to be an endless number of things",
      "start": 175.3,
      "end": 179.04,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-24",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "to get annoyed about.",
      "start": 179.04,
      "end": 180.4,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-25",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I would probably go as far as to say",
      "start": 180.4,
      "end": 183.46,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-26",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "that getting annoyed is the most common emotion of all.",
      "start": 183.46,
      "end": 186.86,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-27",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So let's look at this emotion a little more scientifically.",
      "start": 186.86,
      "end": 190.26,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-28",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "We cannot say that we are all annoyed by exactly the same things.",
      "start": 190.26,
      "end": 194.68,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-29",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "For example, for one person, a selfie stick",
      "start": 194.68,
      "end": 197.4,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-30",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "might be a perfectly handy device,",
      "start": 197.4,
      "end": 199.44,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-31",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "well worth taking with you on holiday.",
      "start": 199.44,
      "end": 201.82
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-32",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "For someone else, seeing someone with this gadget",
      "start": 201.82,
      "end": 204.54,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-33",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "might drive them crazy.",
      "start": 204.54,
      "end": 205.9,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-34",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "In addition, there are almost certainly cultural differences",
      "start": 205.9,
      "end": 208.62,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-35",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "when it comes to what is annoying.",
      "start": 208.62,
      "end": 211,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-36",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Someone raised in Britain, for example,",
      "start": 211,
      "end": 213.04,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-37",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "is unlikely to greet an assistant or owner when entering a shop.",
      "start": 213.04,
      "end": 217.12,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-38",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "In other countries, it would be quite rude not to.",
      "start": 217.12,
      "end": 220.52,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-39",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "There may also be medical reasons.",
      "start": 220.52,
      "end": 222.56,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-40",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "For people with a condition known as misophonia,",
      "start": 222.56,
      "end": 225.28,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-41",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "certain noises like fingers tapping on a keyboard",
      "start": 225.28,
      "end": 228,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-42",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "or someone eating crisps can trigger very strong reactions.",
      "start": 228,
      "end": 231.06
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-43",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But perhaps we can say that there are some general rules",
      "start": 231.06,
      "end": 234.8,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-44",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "as to what makes us annoyed.",
      "start": 234.8,
      "end": 236.84,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-45",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Scientists Joe Palka and journalist Flora Lixman",
      "start": 236.84,
      "end": 239.22
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-46",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "have written a book about this subject",
      "start": 239.22,
      "end": 241.6
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-47",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "which sets out three of those rules.",
      "start": 241.6,
      "end": 243.98
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-48",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The first is that the annoying thing, whatever it is,",
      "start": 243.98,
      "end": 247.38,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-49",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "must be unpleasant without actually being physically harmful.",
      "start": 247.38,
      "end": 250.1
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-50",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "For example, an angry wasp flying around your room",
      "start": 250.1,
      "end": 253.16,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-51",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "wouldn't actually be annoying.",
      "start": 253.16,
      "end": 254.52,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-52",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You know that you're somewhat at risk from a wasp.",
      "start": 254.52,
      "end": 257.92
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-53",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Not so a fly would seem endlessly attracted",
      "start": 257.92,
      "end": 260.64,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-54",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "to circling around the middle of your room,",
      "start": 260.64,
      "end": 263.36
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-55",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "completely ignoring the window you kindly left open for it.",
      "start": 263.36,
      "end": 266.76
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-56",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Secondly, to be annoying,",
      "start": 266.76,
      "end": 268.12,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-57",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "something needs to be as unpredictable as possible,",
      "start": 268.12,
      "end": 270.84,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-58",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and it must also be intermittent,",
      "start": 270.84,
      "end": 272.88,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-59",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "which means that it continually stops and starts again.",
      "start": 272.88,
      "end": 275.94,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-60",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Permanently slow wi-fi is something you can probably get used to.",
      "start": 275.94,
      "end": 279.68,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-61",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "If you know you have slow wi-fi,",
      "start": 279.68,
      "end": 282.06,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-62",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "you'll learn not to depend on it.",
      "start": 282.06,
      "end": 284.44,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-63",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But normally good wi-fi that suddenly stops",
      "start": 284.44,
      "end": 286.82,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-64",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "when you're in the middle of something",
      "start": 286.82,
      "end": 289.2,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-65",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and keeps on stopping at surprising moments",
      "start": 289.2,
      "end": 291.58,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-66",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "can really get on our nerves.",
      "start": 291.58,
      "end": 293.62,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-67",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And here is a final rule.",
      "start": 293.62,
      "end": 295.66,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-68",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Imagine that you order something online.",
      "start": 295.66,
      "end": 297.7,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-69",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You get an email saying that it will arrive on Saturday",
      "start": 297.7,
      "end": 301.44,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-70",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "after 9am.",
      "start": 301.44,
      "end": 302.12,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-71",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Excitedly, you wake up on Saturday morning",
      "start": 302.12,
      "end": 304.5,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-72",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "looking forward to your delivery.",
      "start": 304.5,
      "end": 306.2,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-73",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Time passes and keeps on passing.",
      "start": 306.2,
      "end": 308.24,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-74",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Before you know it, it's 1pm",
      "start": 308.24,
      "end": 310.28,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-75",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and you have absolutely no idea how much longer you have to wait.",
      "start": 310.28,
      "end": 314.7,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-76",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It could be five minutes or five more hours.",
      "start": 314.7,
      "end": 317.76,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-77",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "After 9am begins to seem like it could mean anything.",
      "start": 317.76,
      "end": 321.16,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-78",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Basically, for something to be truly annoying,",
      "start": 321.16,
      "end": 323.54,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-79",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "it has to keep going for an unknown length of time.",
      "start": 323.54,
      "end": 327.28,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-80",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So getting annoyed is extremely common.",
      "start": 327.28,
      "end": 329.32,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-81",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But is there a way to get over it",
      "start": 329.32,
      "end": 332.38,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-82",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and live a life free of always continually getting",
      "start": 332.38,
      "end": 335.44,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-83",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "slightly angry about things?",
      "start": 335.44,
      "end": 336.8,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-84",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Annoyingly, the answer seems to be no.",
      "start": 336.8,
      "end": 339.18,
      "preAudio": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-85",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That is the end of the test.",
      "start": 339.18,
      "end": 322.114,
      "preAudio": false
    }
  ]
}
